    "body": "The corrected roll sequence is installed. The prior port set the chosen heading only once, so the authored animation could accumulate yaw into the reported 270-degree spin. This build follows the reference by retaining the accepted heading throughout both animation phases, with the exact four-direction selector and paired clips. Test all four directions with sidearm/longarm while standing and crouched; the roll must travel in the selected direction without the spin.",
